      {
        "part": "22 pF",
        "symbol": "cap",
        "from": "14",
        "to": "GND",
        "required": true,
        "why": "The matching load capacitor on the other crystal pin."
      }
    ],
    "note": "The configuration word has to select the oscillator mode as well, HS for 20 MHz. Fitting the crystal is not enough on its own, and the same word is where you turn the watchdog off."
